==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~33.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[13th Anniv. Doge Cake]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

